    "body": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION pg_catalog.multirange_gt(anymultirange, anymultirange)\n RETURNS boolean\n LANGUAGE internal\n IMMUTABLE PARALLEL SAFE STRICT\nAS $function$multirange_gt$function$\n",
