    "body": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION pg_catalog.tsrange(timestamp without time zone, timestamp without time zone, text)\n RETURNS tsrange\n LANGUAGE internal\n IMMUTABLE PARALLEL SAFE\nAS $function$range_constructor3$function$\n",
