    "oid": 13274,
    "body": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION information_schema._pg_numeric_precision_radix(typid oid, typmod integer)\n RETURNS integer\n LANGUAGE sql\n IMMUTABLE PARALLEL SAFE STRICT\nRETURN CASE WHEN (typid = ANY (ARRAY[(21)::oid, (23)::oid, (20)::oid, (700)::oid, (701)::oid])) THEN 2 WHEN (typid = (1700)::oid) THEN 10 ELSE NULL::integer END\n",
